  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fopenysm-unofficial-neoforge-port\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/KYoi3sJ6?logo=modrinth&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Modrinth 下载\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/openysm-unofficial-neoforge-port\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1587175?logo=curseforge&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"CurseForge 下载\"></a></p>\n<p>Yes Steve Model 的兼容性更强版本</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/OpenYSM/OpenYSM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/OpenYSM/OpenYSM</a></p>\n<p>OpenYSM 是一款玩家模型修改模组，在提供与 YSM 相同功能的同时解决了其兼容性问题。</p>\n<p>本模组兼容<strong>几乎所有平台</strong>，包括<strong>macOS</strong>、RISC-V，甚至手机。</p>\n<p>原版模组位于 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fopenysm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/mod/openysm</a></p>\n<h2>已集成以下模组的兼容功能：</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><em>Slash Blade:Resharpened</em></strong> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fslashblade-resharped\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/mod/slashblade-resharped</a></li>\n<li><strong><em>Carry On</em></strong> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcarry-on\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/mod/carry-on</a></li>\n<li><strong><em>ParCool!</em></strong> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fparcool\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/mod/parcool</a></li>\n<li><strong><em>Touhou Little Maid</em></strong> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftouhou-little-maid\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/mod/touhou-little-maid</a></li>\n<li><strong><em>Timeless &amp; Classics Guns: Zero (Neoforge port)</em></strong> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftacz-1.21.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/mod/tacz-1.21.1</a></li>\n<li><strong><em>Immersive Melodies</em></strong> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fimmersive-melodies\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-melodies</a></li>\n<li><strong><em>Accelerated Rendering</em></strong> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/accelerated-rendering\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/accelerated-rendering</a></li>\n<li><strong><em>Player Animator</em></strong> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/playeranimator\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/playeranimator</a></li>\n<li><strong><em>Better Combat</em></strong> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbetter-combat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/mod/better-combat</a></li>\n<li><strong><em>Create</em></strong> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/mod/create</a></li>\n<li><strong><em>Elytra Slot</em></strong> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252felytra-slot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/mod/elytra-slot</a></li>\n<li><strong><em>NotEnoughAnimations</em></strong> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fnot-enough-animations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/mod/not-enough-animations</a></li>\n<li><strong><em>Immersive Aircraft</em></strong> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fimmersive-aircraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-aircraft</a></li>\n<li><strong><em>Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks</e